                "pinkish",
                "a"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "en": "“I went to see her,” he said, to nobody in particular. “The churchyard doesn’t open till eight. I was there at seven, which meant the wall. Don’t tell the vicar.”",
            "fr": "« Je suis allé la voir, dit-il, à personne en particulier. Le cimetière n'ouvre qu'à huit heures. J'y étais à sept, ce qui voulait dire le mur. Ne le dites pas au pasteur. »",
            "g": {
              "went": [
                "suis allé",
                "go",
                "v",
                "aller"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "en": "He put the tray down. “I told her I was late. I think she was unsurprised.”",
            "fr": "Il posa le plateau. « Je lui ai dit que j'étais en retard. Je crois qu'elle n'était pas surprise. »",
            "g": {
              "put": [
                "posa (put down)",
